{"id":"2403aee408c56d4d","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-thm-separation.md","title":"Separation","display":"thm-separation — Separation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-separation","aliases":["58-thm-separation"],"display":"thm-separation — Separation","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-separation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-separation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-separation — Separation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x,z_1,\\ldots,z_n)\">\\(\\varphi(x,z_1,\\ldots,z_n)\\)</span> (a fixed first-order formula in which <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> is not free)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_1,\\ldots,p_n\">\\(p_1,\\ldots,p_n\\)</span> (set parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\in V\">\\(A \\in V\\)</span> (set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}separation}\\vdash_{\\varphi}\n\\forall A,p_1,\\ldots,p_n\\in V\\;\n\\exists B\\in V\\;\\forall x\\;\n\\left(\nx\\in B\n\\leftrightarrow\nx\\in A\\land\\varphi(x,p_1,\\ldots,p_n)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}separation}\\vdash_{\\varphi}\n\\forall A,p_1,\\ldots,p_n\\in V\\;\n\\exists B\\in V\\;\\forall x\\;\n\\left(\nx\\in B\n\\leftrightarrow\nx\\in A\\land\\varphi(x,p_1,\\ldots,p_n)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Separation is an axiom schema: one instance is supplied for each fixed formula <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Quantifying internally over all formula codes would require a satisfaction predicate and would not be the ordinary first-order separation schema.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A \\in V$ (set, see [[../batch12/58-df-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi(x,z_1,\\ldots,z_n)","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"p_1,\\ldots,p_n","display":false},{"tex":"A \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}separation}\\vdash_{\\varphi}\n\\forall A,p_1,\\ldots,p_n\\in V\\;\n\\exists B\\in V\\;\\forall x\\;\n\\left(\nx\\in B\n\\leftrightarrow\nx\\in A\\land\\varphi(x,p_1,\\ldots,p_n)\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":939,"backlinks":[{"id":"9398b95a78da977c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4411","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-thm-separation.md|58-thm-separation]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["65418b505fc53093","65d9a1e690c32aad"]}